# Let through staging's locked HTTPS gate by ip-allowlist.sh, one IPv4 per line.
# Install on the STAGING server as /root/ip-allowlist.extra, then run /root/ip-allowlist.sh
# (or the "lock" mode of the staging-access workflow) to apply it.
